msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: atshift DeFt 0.7.3\n"
"PO-Revision-Date: 2026-10-31 20:31+0900\n"
"Last-Translator: at-shift (AI-assisted)\n"
"Language-Team: Japanese\n"
"Language: ja\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
